# U44: re-importing items and skills. Import the sample character's tree and items, then import
# the items again with "Delete skills" and "Delete equipment" unticked (ImportItem overwrites the
# items with the same unique ID; ImportSocketedItems updates the matching socket groups), and a
# third time with "Delete skills" ticked again (the socket group reimport state: the groups are
# snapshotted by key, wiped, re-imported, sorted by the old skill order and restored).
#! u44-expect-label Character list successfully retrieved.
#! u44-expect-xml Farrul
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
fixture net=net.json
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press i
key-up CTRL
frames 2
move 496 198
click LEFTBUTTON
key-down CTRL
press a
key-up CTRL
type "Tester#1234"
move 634 198
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 464 250
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
move 434 286
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 583 286
click LEFTBUTTON
move 718 286
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 434 286
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot kept
move 583 286
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 434 286
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot reimported
frames 1
